# Shopify App Best Practices

Canonical standards: this file (`shopify-stack.mdc`). External docs: [Shopify App Home](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/app-home), [Polaris web components](https://shopify.dev/docs/api/app-home/web-components).

## Embedded setup

- **MUST** load App Bridge + Polaris in app root (`app-bridge.js` with `data-api-key`, `polaris.js`).
- **MUST** keep app embedded in admin; use App Bridge navigation—not full-page redirects that break iframe context.
- **MUST NOT** expose `SHOPIFY_API_SECRET` or offline access tokens to the browser.

## Polaris UI (`s-*` components)

- **MUST** build App Home UI with Polaris web components (`<s-page>`, `<s-section>`, `<s-stack>`, `<s-button>`, …).
- **MUST** structure pages: `<s-page heading="...">` → `<s-section>` → content.
- **MUST** use `direction="inline"` for horizontal stacks (not `horizontal` / `vertical`).
- **MUST** set `accessibilityLabel` on icon-only buttons; `tone="critical"` for destructive actions.
- **SHOULD** put primary CTA in `slot="primary-action"` on `<s-page>`; use `loading` during async saves.
- **MUST NOT** use MUI/Bootstrap/custom admin chrome in embedded screens.

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
<s-page heading="Products">
  <s-button slot="primary-action" variant="primary">Add product</s-button>
  <s-section heading="Catalog">
    <s-stack gap="base">
      <s-button variant="primary" loading={isSaving}>Save</s-button>
    </s-stack>
  </s-section>
</s-page>

// ✗ BAD
<div className="custom-header">Products</motion.div>
<s-stack direction="horizontal">...</s-stack>
<button onClick={save}>Save</button>
```

## App Bridge

- **MUST** check current App Bridge (and Polaris / Admin GraphQL when relevant) standards via the **`shopify-dev`** MCP server in `.cursor/mcp.json` before implementing or changing embedded UI—use `learn_shopify_api` first, then Shopify dev MCP doc tools as needed.
- **MUST** use `useAppBridge()` from `@shopify/app-bridge-react`—not `window.shopify` in components.
- **SHOULD** use `shopify.toast.show()` for merchant feedback; resource picker for product/collection selection.
- **SHOULD** use save bar APIs when forms have unsaved changes.

## Data and security

- **MUST** call Admin API from **server** loaders/actions with `authenticate.admin(request)`.
- **MUST** verify webhook HMAC via `authenticate.webhook(request)`.
- **MUST** validate session/id token on every authenticated API route from the client.
- **SHOULD** use GraphQL with only fields needed in UI; cursor pagination for lists.

```tsx
// ✗ BAD — secret or Admin API in browser
const token = process.env.SHOPIFY_API_SECRET
fetch('https://shop.myshopify.com/admin/api/...', { headers: { 'X-Shopify-Access-Token': token } })
```

## Anti-patterns

- Admin UI without Polaris `s-*` components.
- Skipping webhook signature verification.
- New screens with `@shopify/polaris` React when repo standard is web components (unless legacy-only).
